flowchart TB
    UI[Next.js Workspace + Copilot] --> API[FastAPI: OIDC / RBAC / tenant + cluster scope]
    API --> JOB[Persistent jobs: queue / leases / worker in API lifespan]
    JOB --> SPEC[Bounded read-only specialists]
    SPEC --> SRC[Kubernetes / Prometheus / Loki / Tempo / Argo CD / GitHub]
    SPEC --> EVAL[Evidence integrity + deterministic RCA]
    JOB --> DB[(PostgreSQL / pgvector: jobs / progress / audit / graph / memory)]
    EVAL --> DB
    DB -. graph context .-> JOB
    subgraph REM[Separate remediation service]
      HUMAN[Human approval] --> POLICY[Policy / dry-run / drift checks]
      POLICY --> SCALE[Separate credentials: scale_deployment]
    end
    subgraph VAL[Disposable local validation; no production access]
      KIND[Kind + instrumented workloads + existing telemetry] --> REPORT[Controlled faults / recovery / local reports]
    end
